/**
 * Health care service location information provides information that identifies the place of service
 * or the type of bill related to the location at which a health care service was rendered.
 * It is a composite segment element of a Claim Information segment (CLM), data element C023.
 */
type X12HealthCareServiceLocationInformationCondition {

  /**
   * Code identifying where service were, or may be, performed; the first and second position of the Uniform Bill Type Code
   * fpr Institutional Services or the Place of Service Codes for Professional or Dental Services.
   */
  facilityCodeValue: string

  /**
   * Code identifying the type of facility referenced.
   */
  facilityCodeQualifier: string

  /**
   * Code specifying the frequency of the claim;
   * this is the third position of the Uniform Billing Claim Form Bill Type.
   */
  claimFrequencyTypeCode: string
}
